{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01020","headline":"横吹曲辞 雨雪曲 · 翁绶","name":"横吹曲辞 雨雪曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"边声四合殷河流，雨雪飞来徧陇头。\n铁岭探人迷鸟道，阴山飞将湿貂裘。\n斜飘旌斾过戎帐，半杂风沙入戍楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁绶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}